      "en_US": [
        "Lance: It’s been a long time since I\n",
        "last came here.\r",
        "This is where we commemorate the\n",
        "League Champions for all eternity.\r",
        "Their courageous Pokémon are\n",
        "also inducted.\r",
        "Here today, we witnessed the rise\n",
        "of a new League Champion--\r",
        "a Trainer who feels compassion for,\n",
        "and trust toward, all Pokémon.\r",
        "A Trainer who succeeded through\n",
        "perseverance and determination.\r",
        "The new League Champion who has\n",
        "all the makings of greatness!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, allow me to register you\n",
        "and your partners as Champions!\r"
      ]
    },
